{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/1ec93dc6643d1926bb9d33aeff4294d7.poster.avif?t=1772769508\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/1ec93dc6643d1926bb9d33aeff4294d7.webm?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/1ec93dc6643d1926bb9d33aeff4294d7.mp4?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft. Build. Defend. Automate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest the land to build a sprawling mega-factory and feed the black hole at the world's center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason it wants increasingly advanced tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I wouldn't worry about it too much...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your base from the locals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/e008141a84f36c1409131c230035ad3d.poster.avif?t=1772769508\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/e008141a84f36c1409131c230035ad3d.webm?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/e008141a84f36c1409131c230035ad3d.mp4?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies spawn at night time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a defendable base with automated traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just go out there and take matters into your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like if Terraria and Factorio had a baby...\u00a0<i>oh wait, what's the name of this game again?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest the land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/b28ad52ab1b580f88f3d8271cc9c14de.poster.avif?t=1772769508\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/b28ad52ab1b580f88f3d8271cc9c14de.webm?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/b28ad52ab1b580f88f3d8271cc9c14de.mp4?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the cozy vibes of Stardew Valley's farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You grow all the resources yourself by hand, but automate the collection process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the resources into your factory to craft advanced components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ items &amp; buildings to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 biomes, each with their own automation challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ quests in the tech tree to advance through</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433610?t=1772769508","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3433610?t=1772769508","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/e63649c55385a35b369fd86b8c7164ddf34ff7b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772769508","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/e63649c55385a35b369fd86b8c7164ddf34ff7b5/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772769508","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3434100,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/1ec93dc6643d1926bb9d33aeff4294d7.poster.avif?t=1772769508\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/1ec93dc6643d1926bb9d33aeff4294d7.webm?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/1ec93dc6643d1926bb9d33aeff4294d7.mp4?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Craft. Build. Defend. Automate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest the land to build a sprawling mega-factory and feed the black hole at the world's center.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >For some reason it wants increasingly advanced tech.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I wouldn't worry about it too much...</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Defend your base from the locals</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/e008141a84f36c1409131c230035ad3d.poster.avif?t=1772769508\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/e008141a84f36c1409131c230035ad3d.webm?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/e008141a84f36c1409131c230035ad3d.mp4?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies spawn at night time.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build a defendable base with automated traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or just go out there and take matters into your own hands.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's like if Terraria and Factorio had a baby...\u00a0<i>oh wait, what's the name of this game again?</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Harvest the land</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/b28ad52ab1b580f88f3d8271cc9c14de.poster.avif?t=1772769508\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/b28ad52ab1b580f88f3d8271cc9c14de.webm?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/extras/b28ad52ab1b580f88f3d8271cc9c14de.mp4?t=1772769508\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the cozy vibes of Stardew Valley's farming.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You grow all the resources yourself by hand, but automate the collection process.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Feed the resources into your factory to craft advanced components.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >50+ items &amp; buildings to craft</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3 biomes, each with their own automation challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >40+ quests in the tech tree to advance through</p></li></ul>","developers":["randy"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3433610/aae65a7992eefe13b51793f3ce9490645ff7f3ba/header.jpg?t=1772769508","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirement